        {"zh": "我照着你的脚步挖过去。", "en": "I dig toward the sound of your steps."},
        {"zh": "这条矿道只有一头通着。", "en": "This shaft only opens at one end."},
        {"zh": "我给你留了个坑。", "en": "I have saved a pit for you."},
        {"zh": "你脚下的石板是我铺的。", "en": "The slab under your feet is one I laid."},
        {"zh": "别动，我听着你的呼吸。", "en": "Stay still. I am listening to your breath."},
        {"zh": "先把你的退路挖塌。", "en": "First I cave in your way out."},
        {"zh": "我的镐瞄准的是你的膝盖。", "en": "My pick is aimed at your knee."},
        {"zh": "光太亮，我看不清，但听得到。", "en": "Too bright to see, but I can hear you."},
        {"zh": "再退，就是我的矿坑。", "en": "One step back more, and you are in my pit."},
        {"zh": "这一镐，我等很久了。", "en": "I have waited long for this swing."}
      ]
    },
